cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: assaio
abstract: >-
  Open-source, offline-first CLI for measuring how an organization uses AI
  coding tools: token and cost accounting, and AI-output-versus-cost
  effectiveness per project, across Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI,
  GitHub Copilot CLI, Cline, and agy CLI. agy is Google's Antigravity CLI, which
  publishes no token counter, so it contributes sessions and activity and is
  excluded from every cost figure. Directional local survival is available;
  session-to-PR/review/CI, bug-impact, and quality correlation remain roadmap scope.
authors:
  - name: The assaio Authors
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.26.1
repository-code: https://github.com/assaio/assaio
url: https://github.com/assaio/assaio
date-released: 2026-09-14
